{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhanggu-e-r2-zhouzhao-preface","title":"周昭论失名丧身四患：急论议、争名势、重朋党、务欲速","accounts":[{"id":"zhanggu-a-5017baaaa10b933c3b5d","label":"正文·周昭著书","text":"周昭论失名丧身四患：急论议、争名势、重朋党、务欲速","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e04ac29cba45dc64dbdb"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhanggu-p0006","role":"著书论四患","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e04ac29cba45dc64dbdb"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e04ac29cba45dc64dbdb"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-e04ac29cba45dc64dbdb","source_order":[52,469,0],"order":9390}],"persons":[{"id":"zhanggu-p0006","name":"周昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhanggu-q-e04ac29cba45dc64dbdb","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-43ccad8a48b51ffa6b2f","layer":"original","quote":"古今贤士大夫所以失名丧身、倾家害国者，其由非一也。然要其大归〖1〗，总其常患，四者而已：急论议一也，争名势二也，重朋党三也，务欲速四也。急论议则伤人，争名势则败友，重朋党则蔽主，务欲速则失德。此四者不除，未有能全〔者〕也。","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":468,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
